---@field digitalContentLabelExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.DigitalContentLabelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Digital content label details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DIGITAL_CONTENT_LABEL_EXCLUSION`. Digital content labels are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level digital content label exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude content labels in addition to advertiser exclusions, but can't override them. A line item won't serve if all the digital content labels are excluded.
---@field nativeContentPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.NativeContentPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Native content position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_NATIVE_CONTENT_POSITION`.
---@field ageRangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AgeRangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Age range details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AGE_RANGE`.
---@field carrierAndIspDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.CarrierAndIspAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Carrier and ISP details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CARRIER_AND_ISP`.
---@field sessionPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.SessionPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Session position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_SESSION_POSITION`.
---@field contentGenreDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ContentGenreAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content genre details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_GENRE`.
---@field categoryDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.CategoryAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Category details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CATEGORY`. Targeting a category will also target its subcategories. If a category is excluded from targeting and a subcategory is included, the exclusion will take precedence.
---@field contentOutstreamPositionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ContentOutstreamPositionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content outstream position details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_OUTSTREAM_POSITION`.
---@field proximityLocationListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ProximityLocationListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Proximity location list details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_PROXIMITY_LOCATION_LIST`.
---@field deviceMakeModelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.DeviceMakeModelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Device make and model details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_DEVICE_MAKE_MODEL`.
---@field geoRegionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.GeoRegionAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Geographic region details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_GEO_REGION`.
---@field keywordDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.KeywordAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Keyword details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_KEYWORD`. A maximum of 5000 direct negative keywords can be assigned to a resource. No limit on number of positive keywords that can be assigned.
---@field inheritance? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AssignedTargetingOptionInheritanceEnum|string Output only. The inheritance status of the assigned targeting option.
---@field audienceGroupDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AudienceGroupAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audience targeting details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIENCE_GROUP`. You can only target one audience group option per resource.
---@field languageDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.LanguageAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Language details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_LANGUAGE`.
---@field householdIncomeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.HouseholdIncomeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Household income details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_HOUSEHOLD_INCOME`.
---@field inventorySourceDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.InventorySourceAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Inventory source details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_INVENTORY_SOURCE_DEAL`.
---@field audioContentTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AudioContentTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audio content type details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIO_CONTENT_TYPE`.
---@field negativeKeywordListDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.NegativeKeywordListAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Keyword details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_NEGATIVE_KEYWORD_LIST`. A maximum of 4 negative keyword lists can be assigned to a resource.
---@field genderDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.GenderAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Gender details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_GENDER`.
---@field youtubeChannelPackDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.YoutubeChannelPackAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube channel pack details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL_PACK`.
---@field parentalStatusDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ParentalStatusAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Parental status details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_PARENTAL_STATUS`.
---@field thirdPartyVerifierDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ThirdPartyVerifierAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Third party verification details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_THIRD_PARTY_VERIFIER`.
---@field sensitiveCategoryExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.SensitiveCategoryAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Sensitive category details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_SENSITIVE_CATEGORY_EXCLUSION`. Sensitive categories are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level sensitive category exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude sensitive categories in addition to advertiser exclusions, but can't override them.
---@field viewabilityDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ViewabilityAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Viewability details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_VIEWABILITY`. You can only target one viewability option per resource.
---@field contentThemeExclusionDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ContentThemeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Content theme details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_CONTENT_THEME_EXCLUSION`. Content theme are targeting exclusions. Advertiser level content theme exclusions, if set, are always applied in serving (even though they aren't visible in resource settings). Resource settings can exclude content theme in addition to advertiser exclusions.
---@field exchangeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ExchangeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Exchange details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_EXCHANGE`.
---@field poiDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.PoiAssignedTargetingOptionDetails POI details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_POI`.
---@field targetingType gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.CreateAdvertisersTargetingTypesAssignedTargetingOptionsTargetingTypeEnum|string Required. Identifies the type of this assigned targeting option. Supported targeting types: * `TARGETING_TYPE_CHANNEL` * `TARGETING_TYPE_DIGITAL_CONTENT_LABEL_EXCLUSION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_OMID` * `TARGETING_TYPE_SENSITIVE_CATEGORY_EXCLUSION` * `TARGETING_TYPE_KEYWORD` * `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_VIDEO` * `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL`
---@field advertiserId string Required. The ID of the advertiser.

