---@field youtubeChannelDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.YoutubeChannelAssignedTargetingOptionDetails YouTube channel details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_YOUTUBE_CHANNEL`.
