---@field inventorySourceDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.InventorySourceAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Inventory source details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_INVENTORY_SOURCE_DEAL`.
---@field audioContentTypeDetails? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AudioContentTypeAssignedTargetingOptionDetails Audio content type details. This field will be populated when the targeting_type is `TARGETING_TYPE_AUDIO_CONTENT_TYPE`.
