---@field value? string Optional. The value used by the bidding strategy. This can be set when assigned to line items or ad groups. This field is only applicable for the following strategy types: * `DEMAND_GEN_BIDDING_STRATEGY_TYPE_TARGET_CPA` * `DEMAND_GEN_BIDDING_STRATEGY_TYPE_TARGET_CPC` * `DEMAND_GEN_BIDDING_STRATEGY_TYPE_TARGET_ROAS` Value of this field is in micros of the advertiser's currency or ROAS value. For example, 1000000 represents 1.0 standard units of the currency or 100% ROAS value. If not using an applicable strategy, the value of this field will be 0.

