---@field sellerStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.InventorySourceStatusSellerStatusEnum|string Output only. The status set by the seller for the inventory source. Only applicable for inventory sources synced directly from the publishers. Acceptable values are `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE` and `ENTITY_STATUS_PAUSED`.

