---@field targetingExpansion? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.TargetingExpansionConfig Optional. The [optimized targeting](//support.google.com/displayvideo/answer/12060859) settings of the ad group.
---@field lineItemId? string Required. Immutable. The unique ID of the line item that the ad group belongs to.
---@field adGroupFormat? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AdGroupAdGroupFormatEnum|string Required. Immutable. The format of the ads in the ad group.
---@field entityStatus? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AdGroupEntityStatusEnum|string Required. Controls whether or not the ad group can spend its budget and bid on inventory. If the ad group's parent line item is not active, the ad group can't spend its budget even if its own status is `ENTITY_STATUS_ACTIVE`.
---@field displayName? string Required. The display name of the ad group. Must be UTF-8 encoded with a maximum size of 255 bytes.
---@field productFeedData? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.ProductFeedData Optional. The settings of the product feed in this ad group.
---@field bidStrategy? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.BiddingStrategy Optional. The bidding strategy used by the ad group. Only the youtubeAndPartnersBid and demandGenBid field can be used in the bidding strategy.
---@field adGroupInventoryControl? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.AdGroupInventoryControl Optional. Required for Demand Gen ad groups. Specifies the inventory control of the ad group.
---@field updateMask? string Required. The mask to control which fields to update.
---@field adGroupId string Output only. The unique ID of the ad group. Assigned by the system.
---@field advertiserId string Output only. The unique ID of the advertiser the ad group belongs to.

