---@field deliveryMethod? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.InventorySourceDeliveryMethodEnum|string The delivery method of the inventory source. * For non-guaranteed inventory sources, the only acceptable value is `INVENTORY_SOURCE_DELIVERY_METHOD_PROGRAMMATIC`. * For guaranteed inventory sources, acceptable values are `INVENTORY_SOURCE_DELIVERY_METHOD_TAG` and `INVENTORY_SOURCE_DELIVERY_METHOD_PROGRAMMATIC`.
