---@field inventorySourceSettings? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.YoutubeAndPartnersInventorySourceConfig Settings that control what YouTube and Partners inventories the line item will target.
---@field videoAdInventoryControl? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.VideoAdInventoryControl Optional. The settings to control which inventory is allowed for this line item.
---@field leadFormId? string Optional. The ID of the form to generate leads.
---@field effectiveContentCategory? gcp.unstable.displayvideo_v4.YoutubeAndPartnersSettingsEffectiveContentCategoryEnum|string Output only. The content category which takes effect when serving the line item. When content category is set in both line item and advertiser, the stricter one will take effect when serving the line item. New line items will only inherit the advertiser level setting.

